                    </div>
                    <h3 class="services-title">Build Digital <span class="marker">Productions</span></h3>
                    <div class="services-descr">
                        From bespoke web and app solutions to harnessing the potential of AI and machine
                        learning, our solutions cover software, connected services including advanced devices
                        and robotics.
                    </div>
                    <div class="services-more local-scroll wow fadeInUpShort" data-wow-delay=".3s">
                        <a href="#productions" class="text-link">Learn More</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

